        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3b6f876c-7d4c-5514-9188-4e8541a5aa02",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands and musical acts: Daisy Chainsaw, Generationals, Queenadreena, Ruby Throat\n- People: KatieJane Garside, Ted Joyner, Grant Widmer\n- Places: England, New Orleans, Louisiana\n- Albums and releases: Eleventeen, Con Law\n\nFacts:\n- Daisy Chainsaw were an English alternative rock band active from 1989 to 1995.\n- Daisy Chainsaw originally featured KatieJane Garside as lead vocalist and lyricist on the band's early EPs and on the 1992 debut album Eleventeen.\n- KatieJane Garside departed Daisy Chainsaw in 1993.\n- Generationals are an American new wave duo formed in New Orleans, Louisiana.\n- Generationals consist of Ted Joyner and Grant Widmer.\n- Generationals released their debut album Con Law in July 2009.\n- KatieJane Garside is the frontwoman of Queenadreena and Ruby Throat, and she was formerly a member of Daisy Chainsaw.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
