        "text": "Page: Daisy Chainsaw. Sentence: Daisy Chainsaw were an English alternative rock band, active between 1989 and 1995.\nPage: Daisy Chainsaw. Sentence: They originally featured KatieJane Garside as lead vocalist and lyricist on the band's early EPs and debut album, \"Eleventeen\" (1992), before her departure in 1993.\nPage: Generationals. Sentence: Generationals are an American new wave duo formed in New Orleans, Louisiana.\nPage: Generationals. Sentence: The duo, consisting of Ted Joyner and Grant Widmer, released their debut album, \"Con Law\", in July 2009.\nPage: Lullabies in a Glass Wilderness. Sentence: She is also the frontwoman of Queenadreena, Ruby Throat and formerly of Daisy Chainsaw.",
